• Back no longer closes the app: it goes back one screen at a time.
• Tap an example sentence to open it: listen to it, copy it and look up its kanji.
• After answering, tap any choice to open its kanji or word.
• Word flashcards now show an example sentence.
• Search vocabulary in romaji, e.g. "taberu" finds 食べる.
• Auto-advance now also works in daily reviews, and the Home screen switches in Settings work again.
